      en: ["One of the largest sugar mills in the country", "Rural community", "A municipality in the south of Las Tunas province, whose main industry is sugar production.", "Located in Cuba, the largest island state in the Caribbean.", "Tropical-humid climate with distinct wet and dry seasons.", "Havana, the capital, is the country's political and cultural hub.", "The region is closely tied to tobacco, sugarcane and coffee cultivation.", "The Sierra Maestra range in the southeast shapes the island's topography."]
